# Runpod

- Spell the product **Runpod** (one capital R). "RunPod" is deprecated.
- For any Runpod setup or platform work: fetch https://docs.runpod.io/agent-setup.md and follow it.
- Prefer the Runpod docs MCP (`https://docs.runpod.io/mcp`) when available.

## This project (AILMS)

- Serverless endpoint ID: `br96s8zyygjs24` (queue-based / QB vLLM worker, `MODEL_NAME=Qwen/Qwen3-8B`).
- Public job API (not assumed `/openai/v1`):
  - `POST https://api.runpod.ai/v2/{ENDPOINT_ID}/run`
  - `POST https://api.runpod.ai/v2/{ENDPOINT_ID}/runsync`
  - `GET https://api.runpod.ai/v2/{ENDPOINT_ID}/status/{REQUEST_ID}`
- LLM switch: `LLM_PROVIDER=runpod` (remote) vs `ollama` / `vllm` (local GPU). OCR stays local.
- Auth: `RUNPOD_API_KEY` + `RUNPOD_ENDPOINT_ID` in `backend/.env`.
